---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "RetroOS Museum - Interactive Timeline of 94 Operating Systems"
description: "Explore the complete history of operating systems from 1980 to 2025. Interactive timeline featuring 94 OS from CP/M to visionOS."
bodyClass: "timeline-page"
---

<div class="timeline-container">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="hero-timeline">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        <span class="retro-text">RetroOS</span>
        <span class="museum-text">Museum</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-tagline">Journey through 45 years of computing history</p>
      <p class="hero-stats">
        <span class="stat-item">
          <strong>10</strong> Premium OS
        </span>
        <span class="stat-divider">|</span>
        <span class="stat-item">
          <strong>60+</strong> Applications
        </span>
        <span class="stat-divider">|</span>
        <span class="stat-item">
          <strong>94</strong> OS Timeline
        </span>
        <span class="stat-divider">|</span>
        <span class="stat-item">
          <strong>1980-2025</strong>
        </span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- CRT Effect Toggle -->
    <button id="crt-toggle" class="crt-toggle" aria-label="Toggle CRT effect">
      <span class="toggle-icon">⚡</span> Retro Mode
    </button>
  </section>

